Atty. Reynaldo Robles: So you

01:38:48.570 --> 01:39:06.310
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: have been embedded there for 50 years. Ang tanong ko po, kung mayroon pong ahensya ng gobyerno na magko-conduct ng intelligence or confidential information sa area of operations nyo, ano po ba yung karaniwang SOP?

01:39:10.130 --> 01:39:13.670
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: May I clarify sir, SOP of the army or the police?

01:39:13.830 --> 01:39:32.110
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Ano po yung SOP na ginagawa ng mga ahensya ng gobyerno? Lalong pag sila ay magko-conduct ng intelligence or confidential information sa area ng kagaya niyong army unit.

01:39:32.710 --> 01:39:35.410
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Objection, Your Honor. Speculative, incompetent.

01:39:35.900 --> 01:39:40.240
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: No, Your Honor, I'm just asking about this standard operating procedure, Your Honor.

01:39:40.440 --> 01:39:42.700
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: The witness is supposed to know, Your Honor.

01:39:42.740 --> 01:39:47.220
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: The prosecution is asking the SOP of other agencies, Your Honor.

01:39:47.320 --> 01:39:52.600
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: No, I'm asking the supposed SOP of other agencies.

01:39:53.160 --> 01:39:53.680
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: What

01:39:53.680 --> 01:40:00.420
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: are you leading at counsel? Still in relation to the document being submitted as part of DepEd's liquidation?

01:40:00.680 --> 01:40:13.070
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Yes, Your Honor. In relation to the explanation given by the DepEd during the hearing on 17 October 2024.

01:40:13.550 --> 01:40:43.070
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: With the indulgence of counsels. Colonel Boransing, sinumiti po, sinimuti po ng DepEd bilang bahagi ng sagot nila sa AOM, yung certification na pinirmahan po ninyo, maliban doon sa ibang certifications na in-stipulate kanina, bilang patunay na naging matagumpay yung kanilang confidential operations. Una, nalalaman niyo po ba yan?

01:40:44.330 --> 01:40:52.290
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: No, sir. I am not an intelligence officer, sir. So, I'm not privy to any intelligence officers.

01:40:52.670 --> 01:41:04.000
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Pangalawa. Binanggit nyo po kanina na walang binigay at wala kayong tinanggap na pera mula sa DepEd. Wala rin binigay na pera ang DepEd sa AFP o sa 1st Infantry "Tabak" Division o sa unit ninyo. Tama po ba?

01:41:04.160 --> 01:41:04.760
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir.

01:41:04.900 --> 01:41:16.060
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: But would you know if DepEd spent on that activity on their own people because you collaborated with DepEd on that activity? Would you know? Sabi nyo kanina kasi KKB eh.

01:41:16.320 --> 01:41:30.730
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir. What I know is they arrived there. They were there during the youth leadership summits and traveling, as I know in the government, entails expenses and permission to leave the post, sir.

01:41:30.990 --> 01:41:35.770
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Alam niyo ba na confidential funds ang ginastos para dun sa expenses na iyon o hindi pa?

01:41:35.950 --> 01:41:38.590
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: I have no knowledge about the source of funds, sir.

01:41:38.650 --> 01:41:43.330
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: So you can confirm that no money was given to the AFP or any of its units or...

01:41:46.860 --> 01:41:52.560
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: anyone for anyone in your unit but that DepEd must have spent money on the activities.

01:41:53.450 --> 01:42:02.630
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: I can only speak for the 1st Infantry "Tabak" Division Philippine Army, sir. No funds were downloaded to our specific unit, sir.

01:42:02.890 --> 01:42:07.610
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: But it is very possible that DepEd spent on the YLS and the IECs.

01:42:08.250 --> 01:42:09.010
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir.

01:42:10.170 --> 01:42:16.350
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Final question. Did you spend intelligence or confidential funds for these activities on the part of the AFP?

01:42:18.100 --> 01:42:18.620
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Or

01:42:18.620 --> 01:42:23.080
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: was this part of your regular programming, as you said earlier, chargeable against your regular budget?

01:42:23.790 --> 01:42:28.590
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: It's part of the regular budget, sir. But if I may explain, sir, so that the...

01:42:28.590 --> 01:42:29.590
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: You may, sir.

01:42:29.950 --> 01:42:30.310
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir.

01:42:31.050 --> 01:42:56.790
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: The conduct of the Youth Leadership Summit is part of the campaign, sir. So it involves civil-military operations, combat operations, and intelligence operations. Although I cannot comment about the intelligence operations, sir, but they are interlinked and mutually supporting. So, all Army and AFP operations are intelligence-driven, sir.

01:42:56.990 --> 01:43:04.370
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: So, it's possible that intelligence funds were spent by the AFP in regard or in relation to these activities?

01:43:04.850 --> 01:43:05.390
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir.

01:43:05.800 --> 01:43:07.060
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Your witness, counsel.

01:43:07.320 --> 01:43:07.920
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Thank you, Your Honor.

01:43:07.920 --> 01:43:08.340
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: You may proceed

01:43:08.340 --> 01:43:08.720
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: from there.

01:43:09.870 --> 01:43:22.570
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Ang tanong ko po, balikan ko lang po yung tanong. Di po ba kanina nasabi nyo na ilang dekada na po kayo dyan sa Zamboanga Peninsula?

01:43:24.260 --> 01:43:40.530
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Ang tanong ko lamang po kung merong ahensya ng gobyerno na magkoconduct ng intelligence or confidential information sa area ninyo, meron po bang SOP na dapat sundan?

01:43:42.350 --> 01:43:43.450
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Vague, Your Honor.

01:43:46.230 --> 01:43:46.990
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Vague, incompetent.

01:43:48.500 --> 01:43:51.080
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: What's your response, Atty. Rey, to the objection?

01:43:51.340 --> 01:44:00.220
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Your Honor, it's a simple question, Your Honor. If there is an SOP followed by military units.

01:44:00.800 --> 01:44:06.060
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Your Honor, the witness already mentioned that he is not an intelligence officer. I'm not talking about...

01:44:06.060 --> 01:44:11.480
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: If he knows, counsel, if he knows. If he doesn't, then let that be his response. Colonel Boransing, you may answer, sir.

01:44:11.700 --> 01:44:17.860
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Thank you, Your Honor. I... I wouldn't know, sir, because, again, sir, I'm not an intelligence officer. I'm

01:44:17.860 --> 01:44:18.920
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: a civil-military officer.

01:44:20.000 --> 01:44:30.820
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: May coordination po bang ginawa yung DepEd noong umano'y nag-conduct sila ng intelligence or confidential information noong 2023 sa area ninyo?

01:44:31.060 --> 01:44:32.920
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Pleading, Your Honor.

01:44:32.920 --> 01:44:34.020
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Reform counsel.

01:44:35.310 --> 01:44:47.470
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: So, meron po bang SOP pag magko-conduct ng operations sa area ng isang Kagayan yung division ng Army.

01:44:47.790 --> 01:44:50.130
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Leading, leading, Your Honor, as you've answered.

01:44:51.780 --> 01:44:53.540
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: So, what

01:44:53.540 --> 01:44:53.960
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: is the SOP, sir?

01:44:53.960 --> 01:44:57.940
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Just to get over the hump, counsel, please reform. What is the

01:44:57.940 --> 01:45:02.190
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: SOP, sir? As you've answered, Your Honor. Wala pang sagot, sir.

01:45:02.650 --> 01:45:05.950
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: I'll allow it, counsel. Again, just to get over this hump.

01:45:05.950 --> 01:45:08.540
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Yes, sir. Thank you, Your Honor.

01:45:09.210 --> 01:45:10.530
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: I don't know, sir.

01:45:11.760 --> 01:45:20.200
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: It's not my field of expertise, sir. Again, I'm an infantry operations officer and a civil-military operations officer. It's a completely different field, sir.

01:45:20.300 --> 01:45:23.640
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: We submit, sir. We will move on to another point.

01:45:26.300 --> 01:45:29.540
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Is there a chance you will finish your direct, counsel, before lunch?

01:45:30.640 --> 01:45:31.900
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: I'll try to finish, Your Honor.

01:45:32.560 --> 01:45:35.540
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Kindly do so. Kindly try to do so without pressuring you, counsel.

01:45:35.540 --> 01:45:37.170
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: I have several pages...

01:45:37.170 --> 01:45:38.800
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Please proceed

01:46:04.300 --> 01:46:32.910
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Sabi po kanina noong Usec ng DepEd. Kaya daw po niya isinama yung certification nyo doon sa kanilang sagot sa AOM ay baka dakaw sakali doon sa information na ipinrovide ng DepEd ay galing sa confidential operations. Kaya niya ginamit yung certification niya. Ngayon, ito po yung tanong ko.

01:46:36.390 --> 01:46:49.580
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Sino po sa DepEd? or related parties, ang nag-relay sa, o anong informasyon ang binigay nila sa inyo patungkol doon?

01:46:49.840 --> 01:46:56.060
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Objection, Your Honor. The question is premised on hearsay, Your Honor. No, it's hearsay.

01:46:56.060 --> 01:47:05.410
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: It's not hearsay, Your Honor. They're claiming that to be the fact, Your Honor. I'm just asking him if that is the fact, did they receive any information and from whom?

01:47:05.410 --> 01:47:07.390
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Hearsay, Your Honor, and misleading, Your Honor.

01:47:07.620 --> 01:47:16.740
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Counsel, I even doubt if Colonel Boransing would understand or... Let's see, Colonel Boransing, do you understand the question? Can you answer?

01:47:18.160 --> 01:47:20.840
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: I was about to ask clarifications.

01:47:21.160 --> 01:47:25.820
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: That was uh, I would have sustained on that. Kindly clarify your question, counsel.

01:47:26.380 --> 01:47:39.030
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Sino po sa DepEd ang nag-relay ng information sa inyo tungkol umano sa kanilang confidential information?

01:47:41.810 --> 01:47:53.710
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Na nakuha nila para daw sabihan kayo kung saan at kailan dapat niyong ganapin yung YLS at IEC activities niyo.

01:47:53.890 --> 01:47:58.390
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Objection, Your Honor. No basis, compound, misleading.

01:47:58.590 --> 01:48:00.570
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: There's basis, Your Honor, because that's the claim.

01:48:00.870 --> 01:48:14.280
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: I would have to sustain, counsel, for being compound. And again, The witness might have difficulty answering the question. Kindly simplify your question.

01:48:14.340 --> 01:48:33.450
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: I will reform the question. Mayroon po ba kayong natanggap o sino po sa DepEd ang nagbigay ng information sa inyo tungkol sa kung saan dapat nyo i-conduct yung inyong YLS at IEC operations?

01:48:33.950 --> 01:48:39.900
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Same objection, Your Honor. No basis, Your Honor. Witness has yet been qualified to... answer that question, Your Honor.

01:48:39.920 --> 01:48:43.960
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: I'm the Civil-Military Operations Chief.

01:48:44.220 --> 01:49:06.510
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: With the counsel's indulgence, Colonel Boransing, sa pagpili po ba ng area kung saan nyo ko-conduct ang YLS at saka IEC, meron bang input ang DepEd kaugnay niyan gamit ang di umano confidential information mula sa kanila o mula sa informants nila? Meron po ba o wala dun sa walong area?

01:49:07.070 --> 01:49:30.350
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Sir, in the eight areas, sir, where the Youth Leadership Summit were conducted, sir, there were some inputs from the DepEd, sir, because some of the areas are schools, sir, and many of the participants are students, sir. So definitely, sir, they were involved in the planning and the choosing of the areas, sir.

01:49:30.530 --> 01:49:33.410
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Sino yung nagbigay po ng inputs? Anong level sa DepEd?

01:49:34.270 --> 01:49:37.130
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: If I could look at my records, sir.

01:49:37.230 --> 01:49:38.430
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: You can look at your records, sir.

01:49:50.570 --> 01:49:54.430
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Let's still refer to Lanao del Sur as an example, Colonel Boransing.

01:49:54.430 --> 01:49:54.990
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir.

01:49:55.600 --> 01:49:57.100
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: The one you did in Marawi.

01:50:07.810 --> 01:50:22.180
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: While we're waiting, Attorney Ray, kindly speak closer to the mic so that our TSN people can more accurately get your statements and words.

01:50:25.620 --> 01:50:28.160
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Yes, Colonel Boransing. Sino po si Deped?

01:50:31.800 --> 01:50:44.040
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Your Honor, it's not specified here, the specific name. What's specified here is it was conducted in the municipal gymnasium of Maging Lanao del Sur, sir.

01:50:44.220 --> 01:50:52.560
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Do you remember if it was a local Deped official in the area or a national Deped official that gave you inputs?

01:50:53.280 --> 01:51:09.720
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: It's usually the school principal, the superintendent of a particular school district, the regional officers of the DepEd, sir, that we coordinate with.

01:51:09.820 --> 01:51:12.080
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Usually walang national DepEd official?

01:51:14.120 --> 01:51:17.100
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: National meeting, sir, from the head office.

01:51:17.120 --> 01:51:18.040
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: From the central office.

01:51:19.540 --> 01:51:23.560
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: In my experience in 2023, sir, there was none, sir.

01:51:23.900 --> 01:51:40.470
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Still speaking of your experience in 2023, would you characterize inputs given by DepEd insofar as the conduct of these YLS and IECs to be confidential in nature or the product of confidential activities?

01:51:41.350 --> 01:52:05.200
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: I cannot comment on if it's a product of a confidential activity, sir, but what they... provided us were more of information on the schools schedules of specific schedules of the school year where the students may be allowed to join the youth leadership summit and of course permission to talk with the students.

01:52:05.200 --> 01:52:12.160
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Is it possible that some confidential information were obtained and that was the product of the confidential information they contained?

01:52:12.520 --> 01:52:15.280
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: I have no knowledge about that sir.

01:52:15.790 --> 01:52:17.580
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Your witness, Attorney Robles.

01:52:17.740 --> 01:52:21.640
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Thank you, Your Honor. Can I proceed now?

01:52:21.640 --> 01:52:23.500
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: You may proceed, Counsel.

01:52:23.500 --> 01:52:41.160
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Colonel, yung pong unit niyo, CMO, Civil-Military Operations unit, kayo po yung sabi niyo kanina, ang directang nakatutok sa YLS at IEC activities.

01:52:42.840 --> 01:53:01.490
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Pag nagko-conduct po kayo ng YLS, at IEC activities. Ano pong operations ang ginagawa ng unit nyo para masigurado na maayos at matiwasay na maida-daos yung activities nyo?

01:53:05.300 --> 01:53:29.840
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir. I think it's basically organizational in nature. Planning, implementation, after-activity reviews and calling the subject-matter experts, asking permission from the parents and school of the youth, and then making sure that they enjoy themselves while conducting the activities.

01:53:29.840 --> 01:53:45.530
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Mayroon po bang ibang units ng division nyo na tumutulong para siguraduhin na maayos at mapayapang maidaos yung inyong YLS at IEC activities.

01:53:45.870 --> 01:53:46.750
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Leading, Your Honor.

01:53:47.790 --> 01:53:59.910
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Alin pong mga units ng inyong division ang tumutulong para masiguradong mapayapa at maayos na maisagawa ang inyong YLS activities.

01:54:00.330 --> 01:54:02.630
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Relevance, Your Honor.

01:54:02.750 --> 01:54:03.350
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Witness may answer. Overruled.

01:54:04.220 --> 01:54:04.980
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes,

01:54:05.000 --> 01:54:05.160
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Sir.

01:54:05.220 --> 01:54:06.140
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Thank you, Your Honor, Sir.

01:54:06.420 --> 01:54:39.410
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: These youth leadership summits are usually conducted in high-threat areas. because these students and out-of-school youth are usually the target of recruitment for violent extremism. And we use the whole of government and whole of society approach to prevent this. So while conducting this, we try to find a safe place in coordination with DepEd and other stakeholders, but definitely it's in an area of a higher threat level. So while we are conducting the Youth Leadership Summit,

01:54:42.250 --> 01:54:57.650
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Our infantry units are conducting security operations to ensure that our participants, the activity is not attacked. And of course, the intelligence units also conduct intelligence operations.

01:54:58.090 --> 01:55:01.630
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: So meron po pala kayong intelligence unit, tama po?

01:55:01.630 --> 01:55:03.630
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir.

01:55:03.630 --> 01:55:16.060
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Ilan pong officers ng inyong infantry division yung tumutulong? sa intelligence operations na ginagawa nyo para matiyak

01:55:16.060 --> 01:55:16.900
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: na

01:55:17.030 --> 01:55:25.310
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: diktas at matagumpay na maisagawa itong YLS at IEC activities ninyo?

01:55:27.060 --> 01:55:36.340
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: It's case-to-case basis, Sir. Like for instance, Sir, if it's in Lanao del Sur, it involves a lot more troops. Mga,

01:55:36.340 --> 01:55:39.300
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: when you say a lot more troops, gaano po kadami?

01:55:40.240 --> 01:55:44.960
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Well, again, sir, it depends on the specific area, sir. If

01:55:44.960 --> 01:55:45.680
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: it's anywhere

01:55:46.380 --> 01:55:55.950
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: from 100 to 200, sir. It depends on the threat level, sir.

01:55:55.970 --> 01:56:14.810
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Yes, sir. So, hindi lang naman, tama po ba na sabi niyo, whole of government approach? So, basically, hindi lang po CMO at saka intelligence operatives niyo. Lahat din po ng sundalo nyo are involved. Is that what you're trying to say?

01:56:15.330 --> 01:56:17.200
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Leading, Your Honor.

01:56:17.200 --> 01:56:17.650
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Witness, may answer?

01:56:17.650 --> 01:56:18.100
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: When you say who will approach...

01:56:20.960 --> 01:56:38.080
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: As I earlier said, sir, a army campaign involves mutually supporting efforts, sir. So, from combat operations to civil-military operations and intelligence operations. So, lahat po kasama po, sir.

01:56:38.100 --> 01:56:39.600
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Considering what you've said, sir,

01:56:42.220 --> 01:56:55.240
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: In the YLS and IEC activities that you've conducted through the years, ano po yung naging risulta as a result of your efforts?

01:56:56.240 --> 01:56:57.000
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Thank you, Your Honor.

01:56:58.350 --> 01:57:03.070
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Witness may answer. They've been doing it for over two decades.

01:57:03.070 --> 01:57:03.730
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir.

01:57:05.190 --> 01:57:16.960
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: I can only, maybe, let me start with 2023, sir. It involves the certification, sir. in our area of operations, specifically for the...

01:57:16.960 --> 01:57:39.010
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Colonel, let me just stop you. I'll ask you about 2023 later. But my question is, in the years that you've been conducting the YLS and IEC activities, you said that there were efforts also by CMO and intelligence. Ano po yung nagiging resulta noong pagtutulungan niyo?

01:57:42.150 --> 01:58:34.850
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: It definitely has prevented our recruitment, sir, at least in my personal experience, sir. A lot of these children, youth, are usually misinformed. And this was during the time of, there was no internet yet or texting. So sometimes we were the only representatives of the government that this, we usually have the Youth Leadership Summit and far-flung areas and when the inter-agency technical working group goes up, it's most of the time the first time that they have seen representatives from the government. So, yeah, it's a big part of why the threat level all over the country has gone down. So,

01:58:34.930 --> 01:58:37.960
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: ano po yung sabi niyo, successful po?

01:58:37.960 --> 01:58:39.140
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir.

01:58:39.140 --> 01:58:40.740
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Ngayon, ang tanong ko po sa inyo,

01:58:42.790 --> 01:58:53.450
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Anyway, ang tanong ko po, just an estimate, sir. Ayokong tanong yung exact figures. Ganon po kadaming tao ang strength or number of personnel ng isang division?

01:58:54.520 --> 01:58:55.500
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Relevance, Your Honor.

01:58:55.500 --> 01:58:56.840
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: We'll show the relevance, Your Honor.

01:58:58.430 --> 01:59:01.250
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: I'll allow it, counsel. Kindly move on, counsel.

01:59:02.170 --> 01:59:03.490
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Witness may answer.

01:59:03.490 --> 01:59:12.860
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir. I think it's a public record how many soldiers we have for specific division, but more or less 5,000, sir.

01:59:12.900 --> 01:59:13.540
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: 5,000?

01:59:13.540 --> 01:59:13.940
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir.

01:59:14.060 --> 01:59:24.070
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: So, ito po yung mga naging kasagutan nyo. Meron po kayong around 5,000 troops in the area, estimate.

01:59:25.930 --> 01:59:46.600
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Dekada na po kayong naandun. May sarili kayong civilian military operations team. Meron kayong intelligence operatives. At taon-taon ginagawa nyo na ito at sabi nyo ngayon, successful naman. Ang tanong ko po,

01:59:48.180 --> 01:59:50.700
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: anong nangyari noong 2023?

01:59:52.460 --> 02:00:01.720
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Bakit biglang kailangang gumastos ng confidential funds ang DepEd? para lang matsabi sa inyo

02:00:01.720 --> 02:00:02.660
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: kung

02:00:02.660 --> 02:00:11.410
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: saan nyo dapat gawin iyong inyong YLS at IEC activities, Sir.

02:00:12.210 --> 02:00:16.730
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Objection, Your Honor. Big misleading, no basis, Your Honor.

02:00:17.330 --> 02:00:27.800
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: And witness would be incompetent to answer if indeed, because earlier he said he is not aware if indeed DepEd spent confidential funds or not.

02:00:27.800 --> 02:00:33.440
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: But that DepEd spent for their participants, right, Colonel?

02:00:33.920 --> 02:00:34.500
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir.

02:00:34.500 --> 02:00:38.780
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: That's the claim of the DepEd, sir. We're trying to ask him.

02:00:40.300 --> 02:00:47.520
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Again, the presiding officer sustained the objection on the ground that the witness is incompetent.

02:00:47.530 --> 02:00:48.010
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Thank you, Your Honor.

02:00:48.110 --> 02:00:48.910
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: We'll just move to

02:00:48.910 --> 02:00:52.550
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: another point, Your Honor. To answer on the supposed claim of the respondent.

02:00:52.550 --> 02:00:55.330
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Please proceed, counsel. Move on.

02:00:58.000 --> 02:00:59.420
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Okay. Colonel.

02:01:01.370 --> 02:01:28.950
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Just right in time. I'll ask my final question, Your Honor. Ngayon pong nalaman niyo na kung saan po ginamit yung certification niyo. Ginamit po sa pagsagot sa AOM ng COA para maipasa yung pinlag na 15.54 million na pinaggamitan daw ng confidential funds at ibinayad sa rewards.

02:01:31.920 --> 02:01:37.600
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Kung kayo po ay hihingan ng certification ngayon, sa tingin niyo po ba dapat niyong in-issue yan?

02:01:38.580 --> 02:01:41.540
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Argumentative, Your Honor. Speculative, argumentative.

02:01:41.860 --> 02:01:52.790
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: If it's his final question, counsel, I will allow it. If you know, Colonel Boransing, if you can answer.

02:01:53.450 --> 02:01:55.600
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: I'd like to clarify.

02:01:55.600 --> 02:02:04.530
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Yes. Knowing what you know now, that it was used for this purpose, would you have issued it if you were requested to do that?

02:02:05.110 --> 02:02:08.130
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Your Honor, we register a

02:02:08.130 --> 02:02:09.750
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: continuing objection.

02:02:09.750 --> 02:02:15.250
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Continuing objection is noted. Witness may answer in the manner he deems fit.

02:02:15.880 --> 02:02:33.660
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir. As I answered during the congressional hearing and you could check it in YouTube, sir, it's very speculative. It did not happen that I had prior knowledge and it's hard to speculate what I would have done. Yes, sir. So, I can't answer.

02:02:33.390 --> 02:02:38.560
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: That's your answer. So, thank you very much, Colonel. Thank you very much. Thank you.

02:02:39.760 --> 02:02:43.640
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: An appropriate time to pause? Attorney Lindon?

02:02:43.880 --> 02:02:44.320
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Yes, Your Honor.

02:02:44.780 --> 02:02:46.520
Atty. Reynaldo Robles: Yes, Your Honor.

02:02:50.400 --> 02:02:57.440
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Let's pause for a lunch break and shall resume at 12.45.

02:02:59.810 --> 02:03:12.290
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Colonel, you... Kindly take your lunch, sir. Relax. But the admonition and reminder of the chair applies during recess. You can speak to your counsel as long as it is not about what you just testified on and will be testifying on.

02:03:12.290 --> 02:03:12.870
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Thank you, Your Honor.

02:03:13.290 --> 02:03:14.250
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you.

02:03:18.530 --> 02:03:19.290
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Trial is in recess.

02:53:13.580 --> 02:53:13.900
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Let us

02:53:13.900 --> 02:53:14.340
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: resume.

02:53:17.070 --> 02:53:20.090
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Kindly situate Colonel Boransing to the witness stand.

02:53:21.810 --> 02:53:23.130
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Clerk of Court, Trawasa.

02:53:31.340 --> 02:53:41.540
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Magandang hapon po muli, Colonel. Magpapatuloy po kayo sa inyong testimonya sa ilalim ng nauna niyo pong panunumpa kaninang umaga. Naunawa niyo po iyon?

02:53:41.540 --> 02:53:44.400
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, Your Honor, Sir. Thank you, Sir.

02:53:44.400 --> 02:53:52.810
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Direct was finished before lunch. We now proceed to the cross-examination by counsel for the respondent, Attorney Lindon. You may proceed, sir, when you're ready.

02:53:53.930 --> 02:53:55.670
Atty. Lindon Miguel C. Bacquel: Nothing to cross-examine, Your Honor.

02:53:59.130 --> 02:53:59.650
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Given

02:54:00.700 --> 02:54:23.780
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: that there is no cross, we proceed to the interventions of senator-judges. Senator-Judge Tulfo, Erwin, for his interjection. Annika, kindly. And thereafter, Senator-Judge Risa Hontiveros. Aniga, kindly. And then, Senator-Judge Villanueva, kindly write down and then relay it to the chair. Senator-Judge Tulfo, you may proceed. You have two minutes, sir.

02:54:24.410 --> 02:54:26.750
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer, sir.

02:54:28.270 --> 02:54:47.370
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Colonel Boransing, kung wala po kayong natanggap na pondo from DepEd o para sa 8 Youth Leadership at sa 53 Information Education Campaign noong 2023, Kaya anong pondo po? Saan kayo kumuha ng budget para dito?

02:54:47.370 --> 02:54:47.930
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir.

02:54:47.950 --> 02:55:07.940
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Sir, good afternoon, sir. The funds for the army participants, sir, for coordination and other expenses of the army participants to the Youth Leadership Summit is programmed by the army, sir, through its budget, sir.

02:55:08.420 --> 02:55:12.630
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Pero nasa civil-military operations po kayo di po ba? Tama po ba ito?

02:55:12.630 --> 02:55:13.390
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, Your Honor, sir.

02:55:13.390 --> 02:55:27.290
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Alright. Wala po talaga yung natanggap na kahit na anong suporta, not financially, like yung venue man lang, sinagot ma rin ng DepEd o pagkain o learning modules sa mga events po na ito?

02:55:27.790 --> 02:55:31.870
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Sir, some of the venues are schools, sir.

02:55:31.870 --> 02:55:32.450
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Okay.

02:55:32.450 --> 02:55:39.470
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: So in that sense, sir, tumulong, sir, and making available some of their subject matter experts, sir.

02:55:39.740 --> 02:55:51.380
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Okay. Sino po sa DepEd or any ranking officials na nag-request para mag-issue po ang office ninyo na certification patungkol po sa YLS and IEC activities?

02:55:52.040 --> 02:55:55.580
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Sir, it was then Undersecretary Mempin, Sir.

02:55:56.690 --> 02:55:57.770
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Undersecretary na DepEd,

02:55:57.870 --> 02:55:58.470
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Mempin?

02:55:58.470 --> 02:55:59.630
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, Sir, during that time, Sir.

02:56:00.010 --> 02:56:08.970
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Alam mo ba yung dokumento na pinirmahan mo ay gagamitin sa COA audit para sa liquidation ng DepEd Confidential Fund?

02:56:08.970 --> 02:56:10.590
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: No, sir. I did not know that, sir.

02:56:10.590 --> 02:56:11.890
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: During that time, you did not know?

02:56:11.890 --> 02:56:12.330
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir.

02:56:12.330 --> 02:56:19.110
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: But if you, ika nga, no, na gagamitin yun sa ganun, papipirma ka ba?

02:56:20.110 --> 02:56:32.810
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: As I earlier said, it's hard to speculate, sir, as what I would have done if I had known, sir, since hindi naman po, sir.

02:56:32.970 --> 02:56:46.340
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: I understand. Nakatanggap po ako ang inyong division o sino mang opisyal. sa inyong dibisyon bilang reward money or monetary incentive from DepEd regarding student profiling or anti-insurgency campaign.

02:56:47.020 --> 02:56:58.460
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Sir, we checked sir, wala pong na-release from any government agencies, specifically yung DepEd sir, doon sa 1st Infantry "Tabak" Division, sir.

02:56:58.700 --> 02:57:13.140
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Okay, one last two questions. Did you clear from your higher authorities in the issuance of the certification for the DepEd's 2023 Confidential Fund allocation? Ito po ba ay sinabi ninyo, nagpaalam kayo?

02:57:13.540 --> 02:57:24.600
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir. For the issuance of the certificate, sir, it's written there for the commander, sir. So I ask the permission of our commander, sir.

02:57:25.200 --> 02:57:25.760
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Who

02:57:25.760 --> 02:57:27.040
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: is?

02:57:27.040 --> 02:57:38.320
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Our then commander, sir, 2024, sir, first quarter when the certificate was issued was the retired Major General Gabriel C. Viray III, sir.

02:57:38.420 --> 02:57:43.100
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Did he ask you, para saan ito? Sino humihingi? Did he ask you questions like that?

02:57:43.920 --> 02:57:54.800
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: He was the one who was, he told me to issue, to write the certification, sir, for DepEd, sir. But there was no reason given, sir.

02:57:55.470 --> 02:58:10.210
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Would you have any idea kung may mga other civil-military operations units sa AFP or sa Army na hiningan din ang kalintula, the certification and DepEd during that time?

02:58:10.210 --> 02:58:10.990
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir.

02:58:11.090 --> 02:58:29.230
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: I only found out during the hearing in the lower house in Congress, October 17, 2024, that the other officers' presence were also, they also issued the certificate, sir, for their unit, sir.

02:58:29.230 --> 02:58:30.870
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: From the different CMOs?

02:58:30.870 --> 02:58:34.290
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: From the different infantry divisions, sir.

02:58:34.470 --> 02:58:40.150
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: So, would you happen to know ilan yung infantry divisions na hiningan din ng certifications ng DepEd?

02:58:40.410 --> 02:58:49.230
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Sir, as those present during the hearing, sir, from the 5th Infantry Division, sir, Colonel Sangdaan.

02:58:49.350 --> 02:58:49.750
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Okay.

02:58:51.900 --> 02:59:06.140
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: 7th Infantry Division was Colonel Panopio, who will be the next witness, I think, and Major General Bajao for the 9th Infantry Division, Sir. I only knew because they were also present during the Congressional hearing, Sir.

02:59:06.520 --> 02:59:12.340
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Okay. So, mga CMOs lahat ito, nasa Civil-Military Operations unit sila?

02:59:12.660 --> 02:59:23.390
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Staff, Sir. Staff. We are the General Staff, the Assistant Chief of Staff. for Civil-Military Operations, G7 of Infantry Division, Sir.

02:59:24.050 --> 02:59:30.410
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Would you happen to know kung nagbigay din sila certifications na they did not receive any funds?

02:59:31.210 --> 02:59:37.730
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: They issued almost the same certification, Sir, because it was discussed during the Congressional hearing, Sir.

02:59:37.970 --> 02:59:41.630
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Thank you. I have no more questions, Presiding Officer.

02:59:41.630 --> 02:59:46.810
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you, Senator-Judge Erwin Tulfo. Senator-Judge Risa Hontiveros, you may proceed, ma'am, when you're ready. You have two minutes.

02:59:55.800 --> 02:59:59.540
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Salamat po, Mr. Presiding Officer. Magandang hapon po, Colonel.

03:00:00.000 --> 03:00:00.380
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, ma'am.

03:00:20.000 --> 03:00:25.760
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: [unclear] mga dekada at budget ng Army at ng LGUs ang gamit po para doon. Tama po ba?

03:00:25.760 --> 03:00:26.520
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, ma'am.

03:00:26.520 --> 03:00:40.160
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Alright. So, at nagagawa niyo po yan. Nagagawa po yan ng Army kahit walang confidential funds na ginastos para dyan ang DepEd. Tama rin po ba yun?

03:00:40.940 --> 03:00:53.560
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: I cannot comment on that, Your Honor. I can only say that there were no funds released to the 1st Infantry "Tabak" Division in 2023 from DepEd.

03:00:53.720 --> 03:01:07.460
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So no funds of whatever source kahit pa confi o intel funds, at least sa pagkaalam ninyo, ay ginastos ng DepEd para dun sa YLS at IEC campaign ng Philippine Army.

03:01:07.700 --> 03:01:11.020
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: For the 1st Infantry "Tabak" Division, Philippine Army, ma'am.

03:01:11.060 --> 03:01:12.440
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: For your specific division.

03:01:12.440 --> 03:01:12.780
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes,

03:01:12.780 --> 03:01:13.000
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: ma'am.

03:01:13.060 --> 03:01:45.190
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Okay, sir. And then, so lumalabas po dito sa pagpersensya inyo bilang witness na ginamit po ng DepEd ang certification n'yo bilang justification sa kung paano daw ginastos ng department ang kanilang confidential and intelligence funds. Pero kayo po mismo, Colonel, may sinabi ba kayo sa certification ninyo kung magkano, di umano, ang ginastos ng DepEd para dun sa activities ng Philippine Army?

03:01:46.870 --> 03:01:51.290
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Your Honor, there was no mention of any funds in the certification that we issued.

03:01:53.650 --> 03:02:01.510
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So, no mention of funds, whether regular funds or confidential and intelligence funds ng DepEd dun sa certification ninyo.

03:02:01.510 --> 03:02:01.930
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes,

03:02:01.930 --> 03:02:03.990
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: ma'am. No mention of any funds in the certification.

03:02:04.390 --> 03:02:16.990
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Alright. So, bilang signatory po nung inyong certification, pinapatutuhanan nyo ba na tama ang paggamit ng DepEd sa kanilang confidential and intelligence funds?

03:02:18.210 --> 03:02:20.630
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: No, ma'am. The certification was there.

03:02:29.010 --> 03:02:29.690
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So

03:02:29.690 --> 03:02:44.870
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: yung certification nyo ay purely tungkol sa participation ng department at iba pang stakeholders. Wala kayong pinatutuhanan doon na gumastos sila ng pondo whether regular or confidential and intelligence funds para doon sa activities ng Philippine Army.

03:02:45.170 --> 03:02:45.970
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, ma'am.

03:02:46.270 --> 03:03:08.370
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: And lastly, Colonel, Mr. Presiding Officer, so To confirm lang po, Colonel, wala po kayong nalalaman tungkol sa paano ginastos ng Department of Education ang kanilang confidential and intelligence funds dito sa YLS at IEC campaign activities ng Philippine Army, tama po?

03:03:08.730 --> 03:03:12.070
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, Your Honor, I do not have any personal knowledge.

03:03:12.930 --> 03:03:15.670
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Marami salamat po, Colonel. Marami salamat, Mr. Presiding Officer.

03:03:15.930 --> 03:03:22.990
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you, Senator-Judge Risa Hontiveros. Senator-Judge Villanueva, you may proceed when you're ready. You have two minutes, sir. Thereafter, the Senate President. Thereafter, Senator Lacson.

03:03:23.790 --> 03:03:25.990
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Thank you, Mr. President, Presiding Officer.

03:03:28.890 --> 03:03:45.690
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Colonel, nung hiningan po kayo ng DepEd ng certification, may hiningi po ba sa inyo o meron po kayong hiningi o may alam po kayo na sinabi, ano ang purpose? nitong certification. Bakit kailangan mag-issue ng certification?

03:03:46.530 --> 03:03:51.770
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Your Honor, there was no mention of the purpose of the certification, Sir.

03:03:52.090 --> 03:03:58.870
Sen. Joel Villanueva: So when you were asked to give a certification, ano ho yung nasa isip niyong gawin lang?

03:04:00.290 --> 03:04:22.360
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Precisely what we issued, Sir, it's a certificate that the activities were conducted and the agencies in the certification did the part to make those activities successful.

03:04:23.870 --> 03:04:30.730
Sen. Joel Villanueva: So ang eksaktong intensyon po ninyo sa pag-issue ng certification ay para lamang sabihin may activities?

03:04:32.530 --> 03:04:49.390
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: For them, I think We assume that it would be used for their attendance as we issued with the other agencies involved, sir.

03:04:49.490 --> 03:04:58.590
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Sabi niyo po, for attendance, meron po ba kayong tingin niyo, ano po yung limitasyon na inyong nasa isip nung ginawa po ninyo yung inyong certification?

03:05:00.210 --> 03:05:01.070
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Limitation, sir?

03:05:01.250 --> 03:05:11.360
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Opo, ano po yung limitasyon ng inyong certification? Gumawa po kayo ng certification, ano po yung mga limitasyon nun? Kasi, Kagaya, inuulit ko lang po yung tanong ko, ma'am.

03:05:13.430 --> 03:05:30.800
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Yung gumawa po kayo ng certification, nasa isip po ninyo, ito lang ang limitasyon yan. Yung pag-attend lang, yung activities na aming gagawin, hindi kasama dyan. Ano-ano yung mga limitasyon na nasa isip nyo nung ginawa nyo yung certification?

03:05:32.360 --> 03:05:54.880
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: The request was for... the specific agencies to be mentioned in the certificate, sir, and also the number of youth leadership summits and IEC activities conducted and that it resulted to no recruitment in our area of operations, sir.

03:05:56.200 --> 03:06:16.110
Sen. Joel Villanueva: So yun lang po yun. Colonel! Based on your experience as AFP sa civil-military operations, paano niyo po dinidistinguish ang isang regular activity kagaya po ng YLS at IEC from an actual intelligence gathering activity?

03:06:17.840 --> 03:06:31.770
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Sir, as earlier said sir, intelligence operations are not my field of expertise so I cannot comment. We are an end user. of intelligence from our various intelligence units.

03:06:32.130 --> 03:06:43.150
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Thank you, sir. So, dito po sa IES at YLS, hindi po kayo kumukuha ng mga information, confidential information, hindi po ba ito nagaganap sa mga ganitong activities?

03:06:44.950 --> 03:07:08.420
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: It is being conducted, sir. We have what we call as an intelligence preparation of the battlefield. and part of that is identification of possible recruits by violent extremist groups and the areas are identified by our intelligence units of intelligence officers.

03:07:08.760 --> 03:07:10.960
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Again sir, this happens during the activities?

03:07:11.440 --> 03:07:12.400
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Before sir.

03:07:12.560 --> 03:07:15.880
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Before, so nothing during the activity?

03:07:15.880 --> 03:07:16.780
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Nothing, sir.

03:07:16.780 --> 03:07:27.920
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Okay. So tama po ba na hindi porket ang isang activity ay related to counterinsurgency, ay automatic po na intelligence or confidential activity ito?

03:07:28.930 --> 03:07:43.230
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: As I earlier said, sir, in army operations, be it counterinsurgency, external security operations, it's all driven by intelligence. If we do not have intelligence, we'll...

03:07:44.750 --> 03:07:53.090
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Tagalog po is parang suntok sa buwan po. So the Army and AFP always conducts operations which is intelligence-driven po.

03:07:53.150 --> 03:07:58.550
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Opo. Pero ang pinag-uusapan lang natin dito, Colonel, yung activities. Ito pong IES at YLS.

03:07:58.970 --> 03:08:06.970
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir. There is intelligence operations involved, sir. Because we have to identify our target audience.

03:08:07.150 --> 03:08:13.240
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Yes, but not during the conduct of activity. Before. Yun yung sabi niyo kanina.

03:08:14.060 --> 03:08:27.100
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Yes, sir. The activity itself is leadership summit, sir, with the youth, sir. And there is no intelligence operations when we do the specific activities.

03:08:27.140 --> 03:08:41.090
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Yun po yung gusto kong tumbukin. Salamat po, Colonel. Ang AFP intelligence funds, binabanggit niyo po kanina, medyo gusto kong i-clarify, nagagamit po ba yung intel funds dito sa ganitong activity, IES? YLS.

03:08:41.550 --> 03:08:52.930
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: Sir, it's not my field of expertise, sir. As I said, I am a end-user of intelligence or information gathered by our intelligence operations.

03:08:53.170 --> 03:09:03.370
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Sa inyo pong pagkakaalam, nabibigyan po ba kayo ng panggastos sa ganitong uri ng aktibidades? Hindi po siguro sa itong mga binanggit po ninyo.

03:09:04.690 --> 03:09:06.290
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: What is the source of fund?

03:09:06.370 --> 03:09:08.470
Sen. Joel Villanueva: Yes. Opo, yung source of fund.

03:09:08.470 --> 03:09:08.590
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: We

03:09:08.590 --> 03:09:10.130
Col. Manaros M. Boransing II: have from the Army, sir.

03:09:10.480 --> 03:09:12.080
